To this day, when we get to the time travelers episode where, and here Alex cuts me off, and he wrote in bold, and I won't read what he says here.
直到今天，当我们看到“时间旅行者”那一集时——而在这里，亚历克斯打断了我，他在粗体字里写道，我不会读他在这里写的内容。

00:51:22.402 --> 00:51:30.299
It's filled with spoilers, And then he goes, Josh, you showed so much love and heartache at the same time it's beyond moving.
里面充满了剧透，接着他说：乔希，你在表现爱意的同时展现了如此多的心碎，简直太感人了。

00:51:30.300 --> 00:51:35.019
I keep thinking I would do the same thing to my now wife if I could travel back in time to that science museum.
我一直在想，如果我也能时光倒流回到那家科学博物馆，我也会对现在的妻子做同样的事。

00:51:35.019 --> 00:51:38.340
Oh, and we were expecting our first child this June.
哦，我们今年六月即将迎来我们的第一个孩子。

00:51:38.340 --> 00:51:40.019
Her name will be Victoria.
她的名字叫维多利亚。

00:51:40.019 --> 00:51:43.579
No, not after that, Victoria.
不，不是随那个维多利亚。

00:51:43.579 --> 00:51:48.260
This show still means as much to me as it did when I first watched and I doubt that feeling will ever go away.
这部剧对我的意义依然和刚看时一样重大，我怀疑这种感觉永远不会消失。

00:51:48.260 --> 00:51:58.739
Thank you, Craig and Josh for helping create something truly special that everyone in my family and countless families will enjoy throughout time, all the best, and never forget to suit up, Joel.
谢谢你，克雷格和乔希，帮助创造了如此真正特别的东西，我和我家里的每个人以及无数家庭将在岁月中永远喜爱它，祝一切都好，永远别忘了穿上西装，乔尔。

00:51:58.739 --> 00:51:59.888
Thank you, Joel.
谢谢你，乔尔。

00:51:59.888 --> 00:52:01.179
That is so lovely.
这太美妙了。

00:52:01.179 --> 00:52:03.340
Some moving, beautiful, beautiful message, Joel.
这是一条多么感人、美丽、美好的信息啊，乔尔。

00:52:03.340 --> 00:52:03.840
Thank you.
谢谢你。

00:52:03.840 --> 00:52:09.005
It's hard not to dive in and talk about the spoiler thing so he's talking about, but I'll just second the, what he's talking about.
很难忍住不去深入讨论他提到的剧透部分，但他谈到的那些我完全感同身受。

00:52:08.900 --> 00:52:12.579
You were really, really good in that scene and that's what we were going through too much.
你在那一幕里真的、真的很棒，这也是我们当时经历太多的地方。

00:52:12.579 --> 00:52:18.219
Get there, it's only eight seasons away from right now, for seven, seven, seven, eight, two.
快到了，离现在只有八个季了，哦不，七个，七个，七个，八个，两个。

00:52:18.219 --> 00:52:19.390
That episode's coming up.
那一集就要播出了。

00:52:19.390 --> 00:52:20.139
We'll get there.
我们会演到那里的。

00:52:20.139 --> 00:52:21.139
It's coming out.
就要播出了。

00:52:22.139 --> 00:52:24.139
Three and a half years.
三年半。

00:52:24.139 --> 00:52:26.719
I am guilty.
我有罪。

00:52:26.719 --> 00:52:28.719
Please equip me.
请装备我。

00:52:28.719 --> 00:52:30.719
All sins are forgiven.
所有的罪孽都已被原谅。

00:52:30.719 --> 00:52:32.719
In New York City.
在纽约市。

